One difficulty which may lead to results which do not match:

**Final answer:** **Any ****one**** from:**

- Difficult to judge position of crocodile clip;
- Difficult to measure wire to the nearest mm;
- Contact between the wire and the crocodile clip is not precise;
- Difficult to interpolate readings on metres between graduations;

**[Total: 1  mark]**

> *This question is asking about parts of an experiment performed correctly that are difficult.  Mistakes, such as leaving the wire to heat up, will not gain marks here because the question states that the students perform the experiment ‘carefully’.*
